{"ID":"20240504161431-45qn2ch","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504161431-45qn2ch","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161431-45qn2ch\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504163841-f4p993q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617104500-vnb1h6e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620153014-3jqdsf7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"101檗木（黄柏、黄檗、川柏）","type":"doc","updated":"20240809113514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240504163841-f4p993q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504163841-f4p993q","updated":"20240710091712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"川黄柏"}]},{"ID":"20240504163841-lqks4hh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504163841-lqks4hh","updated":"20240504163841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、重庆、贵州等地。\n【性状】\t呈板片状或浅槽状，长宽不一，厚3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6mm。外表面黄褐色或黄棕色，平坦或具纵沟纹，有的可见皮孔痕及残存的灰褐色粗皮。内表面暗黄色或淡棕色，具细密的纵棱纹。体轻，质硬，断面纤维性，呈裂片状分层，深黄色。气微，味甚苦，嚼之有粘性。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热燥湿，泻火除蒸，解毒疗疮。用于湿热泻痢，黄疸，带下，热淋，脚气，骨蒸劳热，盗汗，遗精，疮疡肿毒，湿疹瘙痒。\n【炙品】\t盐黄柏：取黄柏丝，照盐水炙法炒干。功效滋阴降火。用于阴虚火旺，盗汗骨蒸。\n黄柏炭：取黄柏丝，照炒炭法炒至表面焦黑色。长于止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240504163841-2is4ulg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504163841-2is4ulg","updated":"20240504163841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135206-cre5qge.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240504163841-u6bwcfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":